			IF ThisForm.SaveStockDetail(lScrap)
				*CALLS:ThisForm.SaveStockLstEdit_tmpStkSum(lConsumed, lScrap)
				
				*The tmpStkSum table data has been saved.
				*The balance of Stock line has been Saved.
				*Simplify screen data.
		
